    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Could you go a bit deeper into that interface instability? I'm trying to determine if the \"acting up\" I'm seeing is just transient noise in the data or if it's a precursor to a more systemic failure. Is there a point where the friction coefficient becomes so erratic that the mechanical system just fails to respond as expected?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
